Hello! I'm Antti Kivi, a software engineer, and I write here about my projects, free and open-source software, and politics. I'm a co-proprietor of [Visiosto](https://www.visiosto.fi/en/) where we build accessible websites and interfaces and inclusive digital services. For my day job, I work as the communications adviser at the [National Union of University Students in Finland](https://syl.fi/en/).

# Find me online

- Codeberg: [anttikivi](https://codeberg.org/anttikivi)
- GitHub: [anttikivi](https://github.com/anttikivi)
- Email: [antti@anttikivi.com](mailto:antti@anttikivi.com) ([PGP key]($link.siteAsset('publickey.txt')))
